{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/749943-stupid-sidereal-stuff-ex3-edition","id":749943,"title":"Stupid Sidereal Stuff - Ex3 Edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-02T13:35:01-08:00","id":749943,"title":"Stupid Sidereal Stuff - Ex3 Edition","content":"We are years away from the Sidereal book with all its shit crazy Sidereal Charms, but that doesn't mean we can't throw out wacky ideas in the mean time. What do you expect/hope/dread Ex3 Sidereals being capable of?<br /> <br /> 1. Trading Intimacies with people. A Sidereal can switch an individuals intimacy with one of their own. For example, a Sidereal may have a mission to delay a minor bureaucrat from leaving town until after noon, so he temporarily switches that minor intimacy with the innkeeper. So the Innkeeper will try his best to delay the Bureaucrat from leaving town, while the Sidereal desires to brew the best damn beer in the town. (It may be useful to have someone use &quot;Read Intimacy&quot; charms on your target, so you don't end up with &quot;Seduce Bob the Blacksmith&quot; as an Intimacy.)<br /> <br /> 2. Surprise! You have a little sister. I'll admit, I stole this idea from Buffy the Vampire Slayer. The Sidereal can insert a person into a family. Both the person and the family believe that the person has always been their little sister. I'm undecided whether the Sidereal can insert herself into the family and still remember who she are.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-02-2015, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/a